    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d687">

                <pb facs="0646" n="474" xml:id="pg474"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5804</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Curtis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-13T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 13, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 11, 6 p.m. Department awaiting British reply to Liberia’s reply to
                    conditions of British Ambassador’s memorandum, June 8.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d687-f1"/> When that received instructions will be sent you. Suggest
                    to Liberian President that meanwhile he defer deportation action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
